# camp-rest-combat: load saved game A, make camp, rest for eight hours: a wandering monster finds the party at
# 12:50. Fight it (C: the combat screen, the monsters' and the party's turns), collect the treasure and leave.
# The camp screen is animated, so its keys are `press` (released at the next poll, idle or not).
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A
wait 300
key E
wait 100
press R                  # camp: Rest
wait 60
press H                  # rest time: Hours
wait 20
press I                  # Inc, eight times
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press R                  # start resting; a monster appears
wait 900
shot encounter
key C
wait 200
shot combat-over
key ENTER                # the treasure screen
wait 100
press E                  # Exit
wait 200
shot world-again
quit
